msgstr "$%d起"

msgid "Picks up hay and puts it on a belt. Reaches %.1f m. The first %d cost the normal price, then each one costs more. Max %d."
msgstr "把草抓起来放到传送带上。够得到%.1f米。前%d台按原价，之后一台比一台贵。最多%d台。"

