msgstr "墙"

msgid "A solid steel wall, %.1f m tall. Built in %.0f m sections."
msgstr "实心钢墙，高%.1f米。每段%.0f米。"

msgid "Start wall"
msgstr "墙起点"

msgid "Place wall"
msgstr "放置墙"

msgid "Window Wall"
msgstr "带窗墙"

msgid "WINDOW"
msgstr "窗墙"

msgid "A wall with a %.1f m hole in each section. Hay, belts and people can go through."
msgstr "每段墙上有%.1f米宽的洞口。草、传送带和人都能穿过去。"

msgid "Doorway"
msgstr "门洞"

msgid "DOOR"
msgstr "门洞"

msgid "One wall section with a %.1f m doorway. Snaps into a wall you already built."
msgstr "一段带%.1f米门洞的墙。能嵌进已经建好的墙里。"

msgid "Start doorway"
msgstr "门洞起点"

msgid "Place doorway"
msgstr "放置门洞"

msgid "Roof"
msgstr "屋顶"

msgid "ROOF"
msgstr "屋顶"

msgid "A flat roof, built in %.0f m sections along the top of a wall. Reaches %.0f m in."
msgstr "平屋顶，沿墙顶一段段建，每段%.0f米，往里伸出%.0f米。"

msgid "Start roof"
msgstr "屋顶起点"

msgid "Place roof"
msgstr "放置屋顶"

msgid "Other side"
msgstr "另一侧"

msgid "Angled Roof"
msgstr "斜屋顶"

msgid "PITCH"
msgstr "斜顶"

msgid "A sloped roof that rises %.1f m. Two of them facing each other across a %.0f m building meet in the middle."
msgstr "升高%.1f米的斜屋顶。在%.0f米宽的房子两边各放一个，就会在中间合上。"

msgid "Slope the other way"
msgstr "反方向倾斜"

msgid "Roof Hatch"
msgstr "屋顶天窗"

msgid "HATCH"
msgstr "天窗"

msgid "$%d per bay"
msgstr "每格$%d"

msgid "A roof section with a %.1f m hole and a ladder. Use it to get onto the roof."
msgstr "带%.1f米开口和梯子的一段屋顶。从这里爬上屋顶。"

msgid "Place hatch"
msgstr "放置天窗"

msgid "Turn the hatch"
msgstr "旋转天窗"

msgid "lines itself up with the bays either side"
msgstr "自动和两边的屋顶对齐"

msgid "Railing"
msgstr "栏杆"

msgid "RAIL"
msgstr "栏杆"

msgid "A railing along the edge of a platform."
msgstr "装在平台边上的栏杆。"

msgid "Start rail"
msgstr "栏杆起点"

msgid "Place rail"
msgstr "放置栏杆"

msgid "Belt Splitter"
msgstr "分流器"

msgid "SPLIT"
msgstr "分流"

msgid "$%d"
msgstr "$%d"

msgid "Splits one belt into two, one load each way."
msgstr "把一条传送带分成两条，两边轮流各送一份。"

msgid "Place splitter"
msgstr "放置分流器"

msgid "snaps to the end of a belt run"
msgstr "吸附到传送带末端"

msgid "Compact Splitter"
msgstr "紧凑分流器"

msgid "3 WAY"
msgstr "三路分流"

msgid "Splits one belt evenly across three outputs."
msgstr "把一条传送带平均分给三个出口。"

msgid "Place compact splitter"
msgstr "放置紧凑分流器"

msgid "snaps to an open or covered belt end"
msgstr "吸附在敞开或封闭的传送带末端"

msgid "Smart Splitter"
msgstr "智能分流器"

msgid "SMART"
msgstr "智能分流"

msgid "Routes items by type, with undefined and overflow rules."
msgstr "按类型分送物品，还有「其余全部」和「溢出」规则。"

msgid "Place smart splitter"
msgstr "放置智能分流器"

msgid "U Splitter"
msgstr "U形分流器"

msgid "U SPLIT"
msgstr "U分流"

msgid "Splits one belt into two belts side by side, going the same way."
msgstr "把一条传送带分成并排同向的两条。"

msgid "Place U splitter"
msgstr "放置U形分流器"

msgid "T Junction"
msgstr "T形三通"

msgid "T JUNCT"
msgstr "T三通"

msgid "Sets itself up from its belts: one belt in splits into two, two belts in join into one."
msgstr "根据接上的传送带自动调整：进一条就分成两条，进两条就合成一条。"

msgid "Place T junction"
msgstr "放置T形三通"

msgid "snaps to a belt end  ·  R picks which end the belt goes in"
msgstr "吸附到传送带末端  ·  按R选择传送带从哪个口进"

msgid "Belt Joiner"
msgstr "合流器"

msgid "JOIN"
msgstr "合流"

msgid "Merges two belts into one, one load from each in turn."
msgstr "把两条传送带合成一条，两边轮流各送一份。"

msgid "Place joiner"
msgstr "放置合流器"

msgid "snaps a belt onto the side you face away from"
msgstr "传送带接在你背对的那一侧"

msgid "U Joiner"
msgstr "U形合流器"

msgid "U JOIN"
msgstr "U合流"

msgid "Merges two side by side belts into one."
msgstr "把两条并排的传送带合成一条。"

msgid "Place U joiner"
msgstr "放置U形合流器"

msgid "snaps to the end of a belt run on the side you aim at"
msgstr "吸附到你瞄准那一侧的传送带末端"

msgid "Haystack Scanner"
msgstr "草堆扫描仪"

msgid "SCANNER"
msgstr "扫描仪"

msgid "Checks everything on a belt for needles and keeps them in its drawer. The Mk I stops the belt until you empty it."
msgstr "检查传送带上的每样东西里有没有针，找到就放进抽屉。Mk I 会让传送带停下，等你把抽屉清空。"

msgid "Place scanner"
msgstr "放置扫描仪"

msgid "Hay Compressor"
msgstr "干草打捆机"

msgid "PRESS"
msgstr "打捆"

msgid "Presses %d strands into a bale worth %.1fx loose hay."
msgstr "把%d根草压成一捆，价值是散草的%.1f倍。"

msgid "Place compressor"
msgstr "放置打捆机"

msgid "Hay Wrapper"
msgstr "草捆裹膜机"

msgid "WRAP"
msgstr "裹膜"

msgid "Wraps bales. Takes bales only, so put it after a compressor. Wrapped bales sell for %.2fx a bale."
msgstr "给草捆裹膜。只收草捆，所以要放在打捆机后面。裹膜草捆卖价是普通草捆的%.2f倍。"

msgid "Place wrapper"
msgstr "放置裹膜机"

msgid "Hay Pulper"
msgstr "干草碎浆机"

msgid "PULP"
msgstr "碎浆"

msgid "Place pulper"
msgstr "放置碎浆机"

msgid "Paper Mill"
msgstr "造纸机"

msgid "PAPER"
msgstr "造纸"

msgid "Place paper mill"
msgstr "放置造纸机"

msgid "Feed Disc Press"
msgstr "饲料饼压制机"

msgid "DISCS"
msgstr "饲料饼"

msgid "Presses hay from one belt and eco bricks from another into feed discs worth %.2fx the hay. Uses %d straw and %d bricks a disc and stops if either belt runs out. Any size of brick counts as one brick. It is %d m long with an input on the side, so leave room beside it. Uses %.1f kW."
msgstr "把一条传送带送来的草和另一条送来的环保草砖压成饲料饼，价值是草的%.2f倍。每个饲料饼用%d根草和%d块砖，任何一条传送带断料就会停。砖不分大小，都算一块。机器长%d米，侧面有进料口，旁边要留出空间。耗电%.1f kW。"

msgid "Place feed disc press"
msgstr "放置饲料饼压制机"

msgid "snaps to a belt; run the second belt to the side input after"
msgstr "吸附到传送带上；然后把第二条传送带接到侧面进料口"

msgid "Piston Rake"
msgstr "活塞耙"

msgid "RAKE"
msgstr "耙"

