msgstr "从这取"

msgid "PUT ON"
msgstr "放到这"

msgid "DONE"
msgstr "完成"

msgid "Arms cannot link a splitter. Link the belt going in or out of it."
msgstr "机械臂不能连接分流器。连接进出它的传送带。"

msgid "Arms cannot link a joiner. Link the belt going in or out of it."
msgstr "机械臂不能连接合流器。连接进出它的传送带。"

msgid "This belt is enclosed, so the arm cannot reach inside it."
msgstr "这条传送带是封闭的，机械臂伸不进去。"

msgid "Look at a belt near the arm."
msgstr "看向机械臂旁边的传送带。"

msgid "Out of reach. The arm cannot get to this belt."
msgstr "够不到。机械臂伸不到这条传送带。"

msgid "It takes from this belt. Click again to unlink."
msgstr "它从这条传送带取。再点一次取消。"

msgid "It puts on this belt. Click again to unlink."
msgstr "它往这条传送带上放。再点一次取消。"

msgid "In reach. Click to link this belt."
msgstr "够得到。点一下连接这条传送带。"

msgid "LOW POWER  ·  %d%%"
msgstr ""

msgid "WHERE IT TAKES AND PUTS"
msgstr "从哪取，放到哪"

msgid "WHERE IT PUTS IT"
msgstr "放到哪"

msgid "Any belt in its radius. There is none yet, so lay one beside it."
msgstr "范围内任意传送带。现在还没有，在旁边铺一条。"

msgid "Any belt in its radius. 1 belt right now."
msgstr "范围内任意传送带。现在有1条。"

msgid "Any belt in its radius. %d belt right now, taking turns."
msgid_plural "Any belt in its radius. %d belts right now, taking turns."
msgstr[0] "范围内任意传送带。现在有%d条，轮流放。"

msgid "Anything it picks up in its radius."
msgstr "范围里它会抓的任何东西。"

msgid "Only when this belt is stuck unlocks with Overflow Arm on the tech tree."
msgstr "「只在卡住时」要在科技树里解锁「溢流机械臂」。"

msgid "Any belt in its radius. %d right now."
msgstr "范围内任意传送带。现在有%d条。"

msgid "Leave it alone while it moves. Help out when it jams."
msgstr "在动就别碰。卡住了就帮忙。"

msgid "Only when this belt is stuck"
msgstr "只在这条传送带卡住时"

msgid "Belt, %.1f m away"
msgstr "传送带，%.1f米外"

msgid "Unlink this belt"
msgstr "取消连接这条传送带"

msgid "Nothing to choose right now. This only matters when it picks up loose hay and bigger things off the floor."
msgstr ""

msgid "BIGGEST MODEL"
msgstr "最大型号"

msgid "Can't upgrade: %s."
msgstr "不能升级：%s。"

msgid "UPGRADE TO %s  ·  $%s"
msgstr "升级为%s  ·  $%s"

msgid "HIDE RADIUS  ·  %d:%02d"
msgstr "隐藏范围  ·  %d:%02d"

msgid "SHOW RADIUS"
msgstr "显示范围"

msgid "LONG-REACH"
msgstr "长臂"

msgid "ROBOTIC ARM"
msgstr "机械臂"

msgid "%s or ESC to close"
msgstr "按%s或ESC关闭"

msgid "It lifts what you tick inside its radius onto a nearby belt."
msgstr "把范围里你勾选的东西抓到附近的传送带上。"

msgid "WHAT IT PICKS UP"
msgstr "抓什么"

msgid "Choosing belts unlocks with Belt Links on the tech tree."
msgstr "选择传送带要在科技树里解锁「传送带连接」。"

msgid "CHOOSE BELTS"
msgstr "选择传送带"

msgid "RESET"
msgstr ""

msgid "Unlink every belt. It goes back to any belt in its radius."
msgstr ""

msgid "WHAT SHOULD IT GRAB FIRST?"
msgstr "先抓什么？"

msgid "Loose hay first"
msgstr "先抓散草"

msgid "Keeps the floor tidy. Wads and bales wait until the loose hay is gone."
msgstr "地面保持干净。草团和草捆等散草收完再说。"

msgid "Big things first"
msgstr "先抓大的"

msgid "Bales and wads before loose hay, the biggest first. More hay in every swing."
msgstr "草捆和草团排在散草前面，最大的先抓。每一趟搬的草更多。"

msgid "Whatever is closest"
msgstr "先抓最近的"

msgid "Less swinging, so more loads a minute. The pile still comes last."
msgstr "少转几圈，每分钟多搬几趟。草堆还是排最后。"

msgid "Needles always come first, whatever you pick."
msgstr "不管选哪个，针永远排第一。"

msgid "Choosing what it grabs first unlocks with Pick Order on the tech tree."
msgstr "选先抓什么要在科技树里解锁「抓取顺序」。"

msgid "WORKING"
msgstr "处理中"

